    - rid: 6007911982781956731
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: 4b4851de-f7ec-4108-b69e-4625904a0328
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: 3fdf0bc2-68d0-447f-9a80-5f7da9240e40
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: 9a6b5e35-f003-49a9-abb1-d41367b94130
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 2011, y: 405}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Co ty, \u017Cyjesz w jaskini? To internet! "
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        LeftAdditionalImages: []
        RigthAdditionalImages: []
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 0
    - rid: 6007911982781956732
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: 3fdf0bc2-68d0-447f-9a80-5f7da9240e40
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: 401e1762-7675-4a8d-891a-7879694fec0e
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: 9a6b5e35-f003-49a9-abb1-d41367b94130
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 2466, y: 405}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Ech, widz\u0119, \u017Ce rzeczywi\u015Bcie b\u0119dziesz
          potrzebowa\u0142 przewodnika\u2026 "
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        LeftAdditionalImages: []
        RigthAdditionalImages: []
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 0
    - rid: 6007911982781956733
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: eaa95eb5-ae7b-496f-93ab-d52f6b823853
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: 401e1762-7675-4a8d-891a-7879694fec0e
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: 9a6b5e35-f003-49a9-abb1-d41367b94130
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 2011, y: 741}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Bo tak napisano w scenariuszu. Na \u017Cadn\u0105
          wi\u0119ksz\u0105 rol\u0119 si\u0119 nie zgodzi\u0142em, mam za du\u017Co
          innych projekt\xF3w. A gracze potrzebuj\u0105 takich smaczk\xF3w jak ja,
          \u017Ceby produkcja dosta\u0142a cho\u0107 ten jeden plus na Steamie. "
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        LeftAdditionalImages: []
        RigthAdditionalImages: []
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 0
    - rid: 6007911982781956734
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: adf6fb1c-28cf-4cd7-9e78-818b9eee3f05
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: 401e1762-7675-4a8d-891a-7879694fec0e
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: 9a6b5e35-f003-49a9-abb1-d41367b94130
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 2011, y: 1119}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "A ty co? G\u0142uchy czy pierdolni\u0119ty? Cytatu
          z Bomby te\u017C pewnie nie kojarzysz? Jestem Hed, najlepsze, co mog\u0142o
          si\u0119 przytrafi\u0107 tej amatorskiej produkcji. By\u0142y redaktor
          TVGry, Youtuber, obiekt kultu memiarzy polskiego Internetu, cz\u0142owiek-mem,
          w zasadzie. To prawie jak B\xF3g\u2026 "
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        LeftAdditionalImages: []
        RigthAdditionalImages: []
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 0
    - rid: 6007911982781956735
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: 7e95c9a6-a466-44ff-a75b-9c60ac5b77d7
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: 570fcf2e-d44a-4c4d-a090-5ac420bc82a3
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: e628767b-717c-4634-9650-027726927815
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 1451, y: 1998}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Ja? A co z Tob\u0105? "
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 322c97448bea9ca46a04ae059e483d60, type: 3}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 53b6e59808acfd64b9ea7a34cd263bd9, type: 3}
