        RigthAdditionalImages: []
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 0
    - rid: 6007911982781956797
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: d56cc156-6010-4ca4-b39d-7bcc262d7d4f
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: d100318d-d5e5-4ca6-9832-3f5ed14f31d9
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: f128acf3-dbf9-4abb-877c-b5d129141fc1
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 2930, y: 4809}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "My\u015Blisz, \u017Ce jak wyjm\u0119 mu \u017C\u0105d\u0142o
          z dupska to to b\u0119dzie profanacja zw\u0142ok? "
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8b0fb904dd04b9e4caf726c0f3ae2379, type: 3}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 40e656281b36f8f40b6e0ac1d6775b03, type: 3}
        LeftAdditionalImages: []
        RigthAdditionalImages: []
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 1
    - rid: 6007911982781956798
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: deea7fb7-8292-4e63-9f81-79cdd8c453c1
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: db93e1a0-f54d-44fc-ae85-5c990b2dd2d8
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: ce8f27e1-6ace-4207-8cc4-015ddf4a2084
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 3580, y: 5681}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Rozumiem. To mo\u017Ce chocia\u017C, na po\u017Cegnanie,
          powiesz, \u017Ce niebezpiecznie jest tam i\u015B\u0107 samemu i \u017Cebym
          wzi\u0105\u0142 \"to\", po czym dasz jaki\u015B item?"
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 322c97448bea9ca46a04ae059e483d60, type: 3}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 40e656281b36f8f40b6e0ac1d6775b03, type: 3}
        LeftAdditionalImages: []
        RigthAdditionalImages:
        - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 587bea65bc2ca244b823660f89e5cef6, type: 3}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 1
    - rid: 6007911982781956799
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: 49f7f627-7c47-4c6f-9968-4840d25fc88c
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: 7e95c9a6-a466-44ff-a75b-9c60ac5b77d7
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: e628767b-717c-4634-9650-027726927815
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 798, y: 1998}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Co za durne pytanie, przecie\u017C od razu wiadomo,
          \u017Ce niezale\u017Cnie od odpowiedzi b\u0119dziesz wrogiem. "
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 40e656281b36f8f40b6e0ac1d6775b03, type: 3}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 53b6e59808acfd64b9ea7a34cd263bd9, type: 3}
